          'ngezilimi ezahlukahlukene. Yonke imihlobo ye-Wikipidiya iyafana, '
          'kodwa umehluko obalulekile okwindikimba nakwindlela yokuhlela. '
          'Manje i-Wikipidiya yesiNgisi idinga ama-Wikipidiya angaphezu '
